 ## [Unreleased]
 
+## [0.4.0] - 2026-11-08
+
+### Added
+
+- **Automatic tool input validation.** `ToolRegistry` now validates model-supplied input against the
+  tool's `inputSchema` using JSON Schema. Rejections are returned to the model as a `tool_result`
+  rather than throwing, allowing the AI to correct its own mistake on the next round within the
+  `maxToolRounds` budget.
+
+### Changed
+
+- Tool executors no longer need to defensively validate their input. `ToolRegistry` guarantees that
+  input reaching an executor already satisfies its declared `inputSchema` (required fields, types, and
+  enums).
+- Static tool schemas are compiled once at registration time, catching invalid JSON Schemas at startup.
+- Function-valued tool definitions resolve and validate against the schema current at call time,
+  with compiled validators cached by schema object reference.
+
